          "snippet": {
            "line": 55,
            "text": "theorem phase_split (l : Index B N0) (n : ℕ) (x : Point) (theta : ℝ) :\n    (primaryPiece l).coefficients.frequency n * (primaryPiece l).coefficients.phase n (x, theta) =\n      (primaryPiece l).coefficients.frequency n * phase l n x + (angularMode l n : ℝ) * theta"
